<title>JAPAN: Kobe Steel says sees parent oper prft up in 97/98.</title>
<headline>Kobe Steel says sees parent oper prft up in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kobe Steel Ltd said on Thursday it expects a parent operating profit of 83 billion yen in 1997/98, up from 80.03 billion yen in the previous year.</p>
</text>
